==Battleground==
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[LeMurr]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Two Can]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Darkmadillo]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stage primarily consists of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies, which means [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Kinjirou Cat]] with some Research [[Cat Combo]]s will do very well here, and should be your primary meatshield. At the start of the stage, use Kinjirou Cat with [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to kill the initial peons and Ragin' Gory. After the Ragin' Gory is dead, let your Pizza Cats die to the LeMurr and use Kinjirou Cats to stall until you have a maxed wallet. Once you're ready, kill LeMurr and begin spawning [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] before hitting the base. Once the base is hit, send out [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Catcrates]] to bait out an attack from Dark Dober, before sending send out [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Use Catcrates's [[Conjure]] to Weaken the Dark Dober and allow Awakened Bahamut to survive longer and get more hits in. When Awakened Bahamut dies, spawn [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]] to finish off the Dark Dober. Make sure to use your Breakerblast as well as Mewtone's Conjure alongside Octopus Cat to prevent Mewtone from getting sniped by the Two Cans before killing the Dark Dober. When the Dark Dober is finally dead, the stage is all but won.

